    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shishaki kwīdumīla Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Lehoboamu aho wadaama a ha būtemi, ūbiza na nguzu, ū wei na a Baisilaeli a bose būshiponya ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū īkī bakangomela ū SEEBA, mu ng'waka gwa katanò go būtemi bo ng'wa Lehoboamu, Shishaki ntemi wa Misili wīdumīla ī Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiza kūfuma ī Misili alī na magogoteni shihūmbī na magana abīlī, hamò na badamhīji ba falasa shihūmbī makūmi atandatū, na bashilikale batī na būbalīle, ba kūfuma Libya, Sukoti na Kushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wīdima ī mizengo ya Yuda īyo yalī īpīndīlījiwe ndugu; nī Yelusalemu wīsanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ng'hangi Shemaya wiza ū kūlī Lehoboamu nū kū batongeeji ba Yuda; makanza gene baalī bibilinga mu Yelusalemu kūlwa kūng'ogoha Shishaki; ūbawīla, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘Īkī ng'wanilekile ū nene, nū nene ī haha nalīmulekanīja mugwe mu nkono go ng'wa Shishaki.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batongeeji ba Isilaeli nū ntemi bidoohya; būhaya, “Ū SEEBA alī ntūngīlīja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA aho wabona bidoohya, ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA ūyū gūng'wizīīla ū Shemaya gūlīhaya, “Īkī bidoohya gīko, natūbakenaagūla, nakūbagunanha haha yenīyī. Ū būpelanu wane natīyitīīla ī Yelusalemu mu nzīla ya ng'wa Shishaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike akūbasuga, bamane ūmo wikīlakīlīlile ū būtūmami wa kūnitūmamīla nene, na kūbatūmamīla batemi ba sī jingī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Shishaki ntemi wa Misili aho wagūdumīla ū nzengo gwa Yelusalemu, ūjisola ī sabo ījo jalī jibīkilwe mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, nī jijo jalī jibīkilwe ng'wikūlū lya ntemi. Ūsola būlī shikolo, pyī nī mūda ja zahabu ījo jalī jabeejiwa na Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ntemi Lehoboamu ūbeeja ja feza a ha ng'wanya gwa mūda jenījo; ūjitūūla mu makono ga bataale ba balang'hani, abo bilekelaga ndīīma ja kūlang'hana ha mita gwa kwingīla h'ikūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būl'ikanza ū ntemi ūlū alīja kū hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, a balang'hani bajaga hamò nang'hwe bajibūūkije ī mūda jenījo; ūlū bashoka bajitūūla mu chumba sha balang'hani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Lehoboamu īkī akidoohya, ū būpelanu bo ng'wa SEEBA būgalūka būneka, ūpīla ū kūkenaagūlwa gete. Nīyo ū mu Yuda yandya na kūbeela ī mihayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Lehoboamu wizenga chiza ū mu Yelusalemu ūbiza na nguzu, ongeja kūbiza ntemi; aho alandya kūbiza ntemi walī na myaka makūmi anè na gūmò. Ūtema ū mu Yelusalemu ikanza lya myaka ikūmi na mpungatī; ū mu nzengo ūyo SEEBA walī wagūsola ū mu mizengo ī yose ya mu ng'anda ja Isilaeli gīkī atūūle mo ī lina lyakwe. Ū nina witanagwa ī lina lyakwe Naama, ūmò wa Baamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Lehoboamu akīīta yabūbi nguno ī ng'holò yakwe atītwalīīlile mu kūnkooba SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo ya būtemi bo ng'wa Lehoboamu, kūfuma wandījo kūshisha kū būkalījo wayo yandīkilwe mu shandīkwa sha ng'hangi Shemaya na sha moni Ido, ūyo wandīkaga mihayo ya shibyalīlwe. Ū mu shikū ja ng'wa Lehoboamu, walīho būlūgū wa gwa na gwa a ha gatī yakwe nū Yeloboamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Lehoboamu wifuula hamò na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ūjīkwa mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi. Ng'witūnja wakwe Abiya ūbiza ntemi a ha ng'wanya gwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
